A1. Three real observers, same 8 RPCs (4 prefill-heavy, 4 decode-heavy)
==============================================================================
  8 RPCs complete.

  MODEL observer  (GenAI semconv server + vLLM): 6 instrument(s)
    gen_ai.server.request.duration                       attrs=['gen_ai.operation.name', 'gen_ai.provider.name', 'gen_ai.request.model']
    gen_ai.server.time_per_output_token                  attrs=['gen_ai.operation.name', 'gen_ai.provider.name', 'gen_ai.request.model']
    gen_ai.server.time_to_first_token                    attrs=['gen_ai.operation.name', 'gen_ai.provider.name', 'gen_ai.request.model']
    vllm.request_decode_time_seconds                     attrs=['gen_ai.operation.name', 'gen_ai.provider.name', 'gen_ai.request.model']
    vllm.request_prefill_time_seconds                    attrs=['gen_ai.operation.name', 'gen_ai.provider.name', 'gen_ai.request.model']
    vllm.request_queue_time_seconds                      attrs=['gen_ai.operation.name', 'gen_ai.provider.name', 'gen_ai.request.model']

  TRANSPORT observer (gRPC's OWN A66 plugin): 8 instrument(s)
    grpc.client.attempt.duration                         attrs=['grpc.method', 'grpc.status', 'grpc.target']
    grpc.client.attempt.rcvd_total_compressed_message_size attrs=['grpc.method', 'grpc.status', 'grpc.target']
    grpc.client.attempt.sent_total_compressed_message_size attrs=['grpc.method', 'grpc.status', 'grpc.target']
    grpc.client.attempt.started                          attrs=['grpc.method', 'grpc.target']
    grpc.server.call.duration                            attrs=['grpc.method', 'grpc.status']
    grpc.server.call.rcvd_total_compressed_message_size  attrs=['grpc.method', 'grpc.status']
    grpc.server.call.sent_total_compressed_message_size  attrs=['grpc.method', 'grpc.status']
    grpc.server.call.started                             attrs=['grpc.method']

  CLIENT observer (the two PROPOSED histograms): 2 instrument(s)
    grpc.client.attempt.inter_message_gap                attrs=['grpc.method', 'grpc.status', 'grpc.target']
    grpc.client.attempt.time_to_first_message            attrs=['grpc.method', 'grpc.status', 'grpc.target']

