==============================================================================
A3. THE JOIN QUESTION -- can these go on one dashboard panel?
==============================================================================

  MODEL     attribute keys (3): ['gen_ai.operation.name', 'gen_ai.provider.name', 'gen_ai.request.model']
  TRANSPORT attribute keys (3): ['grpc.method', 'grpc.status', 'grpc.target']
  CLIENT    attribute keys (3): ['grpc.method', 'grpc.status', 'grpc.target']
  MODEL n TRANSPORT = EMPTY SET
  MODEL n CLIENT = EMPTY SET
  TRANSPORT n CLIENT = ['grpc.method', 'grpc.status', 'grpc.target']

  -> No attribute in common between the model server's metrics and the
     transport's. Not different names for the same dimension -- no shared
     dimension at all. Nothing to group_by jointly, nothing to filter both
     by. The handoff has no join key, so it happens in a meeting.
